<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0617_T27R0401_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When I was young, the sky went\nBLACK outta nowhere.\rA giant flyin’ homie was blockin’\nout the sun. Like a bird and a\fdragon.\rNobody believed me. My mama said it\nwas a cloud. I said MAMA, CLOUDS\fDON’T ROAR.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0617_T27R0401_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There deadass a homie that big?\rIf it’s real, it gotta be strong. Or\nit lie a lot about its size. Like my\funcle.</language>
	</row>
</body>
